{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collaboration DLC with the popular Japanese hardcore techno label &quot;HARDCORE TANO*C&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring popular tracks from HARDCORE TANO*C, along with special mashup tracks where TANO*C members\u2019 songs are mashed up by Getty &amp; Srav3R!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchasing unlocks in-game skins and themes inspired by HARDCORE TANO*C!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932520/extras/3e88a348bd7361009cef8d4dbc6a4f7c.avif?t=1756365728\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The following songs will be added to the &quot;FREEPLAY&quot; mode!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Away feat. Yukacco / DJ Noriken &amp; DJ Genki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALiVE / REDALiCE</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movin' / Massive New Krew</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitched Character / Kobaryo</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAKKY / Getty</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You &amp; DIE / USAO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u03a3 / DJ Myosuke &amp; Gram &amp; t+pazolite</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then,HARDCORE TANO*C members have created:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOriginal tracks for MASH VP! Re:VISION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOriginal tracks for the arcade rhythm game ChronoCircle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These tracks have been mashed up <strong>by TANO*C members Srav3R and Getty,</strong> transforming them into special mashup tracks that transcend the boundaries between games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932520/extras/9a7758143456a70f4e1c10e2db059cf6.avif?t=1756365728\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Special mashup tracks will be added to the &quot;MASH UP&quot; mode!</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomorrow Night x Late Night Coastline / REDALiCE &amp; Srav3R</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000Mashup Arranged by Getty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late Night Coastline x Blue Streams / Srav3R &amp; DJ Noriken</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000Mashup Arranged by Srav3R</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Additionally, in-game skins and system themes inspired by HARDCORE TANO*C will be added!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{Skin announcement image}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following skins and themes can be obtained:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C Theme Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C NOTE Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C EFFECT Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C JUDGE Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C COMBO Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C LANE Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C GEAR Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C BACKGROUND Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TANO*C SE Skin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932520?t=1756365728","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932520?t=1756365728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams